                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) If management and the Union agree that a problem exists that will not allow reasonable time for each employee to make their selection then the problem will be resolved between the Company and the Union (Business Manager and Manager of the department or their representative) in an expedient manner.",
