        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 11.4.1. If a holiday occurs within a vacation period on an employee's otherwise scheduled tour of duty, the holiday shall not be counted as part of the vacation but an additional day off, with appropriate holiday pay allowance shall be granted. The additional day off, however, must be taken at a convenient time agreeable to the company and must be scheduled at the time the vacation selection is made. As an option, the employee may be granted with supervisory approval an extra day's pay at the regular straight-time rate.",
            "block_bbox": [
