        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 11.5.1. An employee who suffers illness disability during vacation time off shall be considered as being on vacation for the full week during which the disability occurs. Any remaining vacation time may be applied as an off set against the waiting period and full Disability Benefits under the Company's Disability Benefit Plan. Otherwise, the waiting period commences with the first day on which the employee would normally report back to work.",
